 **********************************************
 ********* Roland GP-16 Patch Chart ***********
 **********************************************
 
 Patch Name: Clean crisp
     Author: Thomas Edlund
   Comments: Nice really clean crisp sound.
 
 PROGRAM CHANGE NO.  B: 14
 
 SEQUENCE BLOCK A	123456
 SEQUENCE BLOCK B       142536
 
 BLOCK A - ON/OFF       1***56
 BLOCK B - ON/OFF       *2****
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-1 COMPRESSOR
 
    TONE 0
  ATTACK 100
 SUSTAIN 80
   LEVEL 75
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-5 PARAMETRIC EQ
 
    HI FREQ 8.00 kHz
   HI LEVEL +12.0 dB
 
   H.M.FREQ 4.00 kHz
     H.M. Q 1.0
 H.M. LEVEL +1.0 dB
 
  L.M. FREQ 1.00 kHz
     L.M. Q 1.0
 L.M. LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
    LO FREQ 250 Hz
   LO LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
  OUT LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-6 NOISE SUPPRESSOR
 
    SENS 22
 RELEASE 5
   LEVEL 100
 
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-2 
 	a. CHORUS
 
 P. DELAY 20 msec
     RATE 10
    DEPTH 75
 E. LEVEL 90
 
 ----------------------------------
 MASTER VOLUME 100
 
 
 ----------------------------------
 EXPRESSION PEDAL
 
 ASSIGN OFF

 ----------------------------------
 OUTPUT SELECT
 
 CHANNEL  1

